# REQUIRES: haydn
# RUN: yaml2obj %S/Inputs/text16-e96.yaml -o %t.o
# Stamp product EF_HAYDN_E96 (e_flags=0x1) on the yaml object. yaml2obj has
# no Haydn e_flags bit names; LLD rejects unprofiled zero flags fail-closed.
# RUN: %python -c "import struct,sys;f=open(sys.argv[1],'r+b');f.seek(36);f.write(struct.pack('<I',1));f.close()" %t.o
# RUN: ld.lld -T %S/haydn.ld %t.o -o %t
# RUN: llvm-readobj -S %t | FileCheck %s
#
# Product script pads .text to a multiple of HAYDN_PRODUCT_PARCEL_BYTES
# (production EncodedBytes; currently 12) so BundleSim ASSERT % record-size
# is satisfied. Object has 16 bytes of .text → pad to 24.

# CHECK: Name: .text
# CHECK: Address: 0x10000
# CHECK: Size: 24
